From 96e61c4815f798554bb1f71b5346e75cfabffd79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dogty <dogty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] relay/ldn: thread-safe transport, bound-port wakeups,
 lp2p refusal, hardened joins
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

移植加固波次(ef9e14f 83c9ac5 5a3e9c1 6be8086 a20d235 7bb62b6):

- bsd mitm: 记录绕过中继的发送;Poll/Select 唤醒绑定端口对应的接收
  套接字,recvfrom 无地址缓冲也照样送达帧;按绑定端口匹配并服务
- relay: 队列帧即时排空;非阻塞接收不再空转;RelayTransport 套接字
  状态加锁(bsd 线程与 worker 线程并发 Open/Reopen 不再竞态);
  TCP 隧道在重连间保持,发送失败或未知 stream id 时干净关闭;
  relay.cfg 读取上限 4 KiB 且不会把截断读写回
- ldn: SetProtocol 拒绝 lp2p 协议;relay Connect 携带目标 bssid 并
  指向单一主机;失败加入清理加入状态;畸形数据报不再终止会话;
  站点套接字仅在 dataMutex 下变更

Squashed from aylz10/ldn_mitm2 commits (author: dogty):
ef9e14f 83c9ac5 5a3e9c1 6be8086 a20d235 7bb62b6

Ported-from: https://github.com/aylz10/ldn_mitm2/tree/beta/bsd-broadcast-relay-TONYX9000
